00:00:10.041 --> 00:00:12.400
16-year-old Mario is a hard worker.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.480
He's on the track and debate teams.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.100
He tutors kids in English
and social studies.

