00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.150
He got a perfect score on the ACTs,

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.220
the full 36 points.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:38.500
We have this remarkable high school junior

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.520
