00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.660
Let's say hi to Mario,

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.987
who watches on NBC Chicago!
- (applause and cheers)

00:00:43.987 --> 00:00:46.620
[Kelly Clarkson] Congratulations.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:47.560
- Thank you.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.393
- Oh my gosh,

00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:50.090
were you freaking out when you found out

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.000
you got the perfect score?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.540
- Yes. Yes, I did.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.390
Um, so, when I got the perfect
score, I never expected it.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:00.880
It was a, I expected like
a 32, a 34, very high score

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.800
