00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.670
And when I got it, I was like, oh my gosh.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:06.850
And I was like, mother, mother.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.759
And she was like, it's gonna be fine,

00:01:08.759 --> 00:01:09.592
it's gonna be fine.

00:01:09.592 --> 00:01:10.757
So, I threw my iPad downstairs

00:01:10.757 --> 00:01:12.817
and then she saw what it actually was.

00:01:12.817 --> 00:01:14.860
And then she was like, oh
my gosh, she was screaming

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.270
yelling up and down.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.050
And people from my school
had the same reaction,

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.410
they were so excited for me.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.640
Like, beyond excited for me.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.010
People even started
calling me Mr. Thirty-Six,

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:25.300
