00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.500
I'm nowhere near perfect,

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.540
I'm only human.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:28.580
And, I'm only a junior,

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:30.178
I still have another year to go

00:01:30.178 --> 00:01:32.300
before I even apply to colleges.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.810
But, I know I do wanna
go to Columbia University

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.500
in New York. That's my dream school.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.680
And, actually, this summer,

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.726
I'll be going to study in Oxford. So.

00:01:40.726 --> 00:01:41.559
- What?

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:42.640
[Mario] I'll be studying neuroscience.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.350
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:46.070
Look at you just living your best life.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:47.910
You're so smart, you're brilliant.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:48.750
That's amazing.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:49.790
And, you know what it is.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.730
It's not luck, man.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:51.670
That's hard work.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.200
You, you worked your tail off to do that.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.600
That's, that's what hard work-

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.850
It pays off.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.100
Congratulations, man.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.000
On, on the hard work and on
just having a perfect score.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.440
No, one's in that in 44 years, way to go.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:06.918
Um, I'm liking your post
right now, right Mario?

00:02:06.918 --> 00:02:08.048
